      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T16:23:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I realize it\u0027s rather late to mention this, but this is a fairly terrible name.\n\nAeadContext would be better (abbreviations are generally bad).\n\nBut \"Context\" doesn\u0027t feel quite right. AeadInstance?\nPerhaps context is enough, given that it\u0027s deliberately fairly close to the bssl API.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 108,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "99916fdbd240341e9adabafffc8535c36259603a",
