        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-06T09:39:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this wrapper is intended to encapsulate the `EVP_AEAD_CTX` object from bssl, I feel it consistent to use the naming conventions from bssl for the wrapper\u0027s API in general. However, if you prefer a more descriptive name like \"Context\", I\u0027m fine to replace `Ctx` with `Context` for AEAD and other bssl objects. wdyt?",
      "parentUuid": "78e232e7_c4a28d0e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 108,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "99916fdbd240341e9adabafffc8535c36259603a",
